<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύρ-δην</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύρδαν</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			210.39
		</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.531
		</span></i> (Antip. Thess.):—Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in utter confusion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				812
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. μάχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.1.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεσωρεῦσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.8.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα εἰκῇ καὶ φ. ἐπράττετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					30.11.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύρει φ.</span> drags
				<i>headlong,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύρω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			) <i>with defilement,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίδαρον . . φ. μεστὸν ἔχουσα φόνου</span>
			<u>AP</u>l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τείρων φῶτας
				ἐκβιάζεται</span> Keil-Premerstein <i>Erster Bericht</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				p.9
			</span></i>.</div>
